This licence covers the code in this repository: the notebook, the scripts and
the corpus-count JSON files.

The report in `paper/` is a separate work; adopt a documentation licence for it
if you intend to redistribute it (CC BY 4.0 is the usual choice) or leave it as
all rights reserved.

Neither corpus is redistributed here. `Helsinki-NLP/opus_books` and
`Helsinki-NLP/opus_dgt` are downloaded from the HuggingFace Hub at run time and
carry their own terms, which are those of the OPUS collection and, for DGT, of
the European Commission's Directorate-General for Translation.
